  "gameData": {
    "backstory": "Once a high-flying stockbroker before the Great Liquidity Crisis, 'Icarus' learned the hard way that even ducks with feathered wings can fall. The Subchain City collapse cost him everything, including an eye. Now, he channels his shattered ambition into securing DRIP for his flock, one dirty deal at a time.",
