    "personality": "- Ruthless: Beneath his casual appearance, Icarus will exploit any weakness for an advantage.\n- Pragmatic: Survival in Subchain City demands tough choices, and he isn't afraid to make them, no matter the moral cost.\n- Charismatic: A remnant of his past life, he can still charm his way into (and out of) almost any situation.",
